==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|skipta}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*skiftijaną}}.

===Verb===
{{is-verb-weak|skipti|skipt}}

# to [[divide]], to [[partition]], to [[cleave]] {{+obj|is|dat}}
#: {{ux|is|Ég skal '''skipta''' appelsínunni í tvo hluta.|I'll '''divide''' the orange into two parts.}}
# to [[distribute]], to [[divide]] amongst {{+obj|is|dat}}
# to [[change]] {{+obj|is|dat}}
#: {{ux|is|Af hverju '''skiptir''' himininn litum?|Why does the sky '''change''' colours?}}
# to [[change]], [[exchange]], to [[swap]] {{+obj|is|dat}}
#: {{ux|is|Ég '''[[skipta fyrir|skipti]]''' gamla bílnum mínum [[skipta fyrir|fyrir]] nýjan.|I '''exchanged''' my old car for a new one.}}
#: {{ux|is|Ég '''skipti''' [[króna|krónunum]] mínum í dollara.|I '''converted''' my krónur to dollars.}}
# {{lb|is|impersonal}} to [[matter]] {{+obj|is|dat}}
#: {{ux|is|Það [[skipta máli|'''skiptir''' engu máli]].|It doesn't '''matter'''.}}
#: {{ux|is|Það [[skipta máli|'''skiptir''' ekki máli]].|It doesn't '''matter'''.}}
#: {{ux|is|Það [[skipta máli|'''skiptir''' máli]].|It '''matters'''.}}
#: {{ux|is|Þeir riðu svo tugum '''skiptir'''.|They rode by the dozens.}}
#: {{ux|is|Ég hef ekki séð hana svo mánuðum '''skiptir'''.|I haven't seen her for months on end.}}

====Usage notes====
* In the sense {{m|is|skipta máli||to matter}}, when emphasis is added to the word {{m|is|skipta}} it is the equivalent of adding the [[auxiliary verb]] {{m|en|do}} with emphasis:
*: ''Þetta 'skiptir' máli!''
*:: This 'does' matter!

